>> #       Note: the Li/Merz monovalent set is loaded only to get Tl+,
>> #          Cu+, Ag+ NH4+, H3O+.  Since we load Joung-Cheatham second,
>> #          the alkali halide parameters come from the Joung-Cheatham set
>> #
